# The default cascade: the notations of a view without nt:notations. All current views have none, so they open
# as today: marks, SHACL cards and pills, value sets, instance cards. The class-diagram notation is a choice of a view.

@prefix nt:  <osg://vocab/notation#> .
@prefix mkn: <osg://vocab/notation/marks#> .
@prefix shn: <osg://vocab/notation/shapes#> .
@prefix vsn: <osg://vocab/notation/skos#> .
@prefix inn: <osg://vocab/notation/instances#> .

nt:default nt:notations ( mkn:notation shn:notation vsn:notation inn:notation ) .
